<title>UK: BNG adds 1.0 bln rand to Dec 2020 zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>BNG adds 1.0 bln rand to Dec 2020 zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following zero-coupon bond has been increased to 5.0 billion rand from 4.0 billion rand, lead manager Toronto Dominion said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    5.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    29.DEC.20</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  4.975     PAY DATE    29.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  37.5 BP   REOFFER    4.725     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5 BP   SELL CONC  25 BP     GOV LAW     DUTCH</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   LISTING    LUX/AMST  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		ORIGINAL DEAL LAUNCHED 29.APR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
